-# One ROM Slot Colour
-
-A user plugin that lights One ROM's RGB LED using a different colour depending on
-the slot (image) loaded at boot.
-
-| Slot | Colour |
-| --- | --- |
-| 0 | Red |
-| 1 | Green |
-| 2 | Blue |
-| 3 | Yellow |
-| 4 | Cyan |
-| 5 | Magenta |
-| 6 | Orange |
-| 7 | White |
-
-The colours wrap if a slot > 7 is booted.
-
-## Building
-
-```bash
-make
-```
-
-This creates `build/plugin_user.bin`.
